            "review_title": "Review at Mợ - A Vietnamese Fusion Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Navigator30482098573\n2 contributions\n0\nSimple Food, Big Comfort – That’s Mợ\nNov 2025 • Solo\nThe dishes are simple yet full of flavor, just like something your mom would make on a rainy day. I especially love how Mợ keeps everything authentic and comforting, from the friendly staff to the familiar tastes. If you’re looking for a place that serves heartwarming meals and genuine vibes, Mợ is definitely worth a visit.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 3, 2025",
